cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark harness, datasets, or evaluation rubrics in research
  or products, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "Skillware-Bench: The Empirical Benchmark & Evaluation Harness for Governed Agent Skills"
abstract: >-
  Skillware-Bench is a transparent, open-source benchmark suite and evaluation
  harness designed to measure how frontier LLMs and agent runtimes utilize
  governed registry skills. Unlike generic function-calling benchmarks,
  Skillware-Bench measures multi-action procedural compliance, constitutional
  safety gates (preview-before-send, dry-runs, ambiguous consent), comparative
  with-vs-without skill efficiency (token bloat, latency, cost), and end-to-end
  real-world simulation crucibles.
version: "0.3.3"
